<title>USA: Abington to buy back up to 187,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Abington to buy back up to 187,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>ABINGTON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abington Bancorp Inc said Thursday its board has authorized the company to repurchase up to 10 percent or 187,000 of its outstanding common shares.</p>
<p>Bancorp, parent of Abington Savings Bank, said its board also declared a $0.10 a share quarterly cash dividend for holders of common stock.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable April 24 to stockholders of record as of April 10, it said.</p>
</text>
